ntific writing"},{"type":"h","text":"Evidence evaluation"},{"type":"h","text":"Portfolio to Build"},{"type":"table","header":["Portfolio Item","Target"],"rows":[[{"text":"Clinical Case Presentations"},{"text":"10+"}],[{"text":"Lifestyle-Management Case Analyses"},{"text":"5+"}],[{"text":"Yoga Therapy Case Studies"},{"text":"5+"}],[{"text":"Nutrition Projects"},{"text":"3+"}],[{"text":"Research Projects"},{"text":"1–2"}],[{"text":"Literature Reviews"},{"text":"3+"}],[{"text":"Community Health Projects"},{"text":"2+"}],[{"text":"Health-Education Materials"},{"text":"5+"}],[{"text":"Research Poster / Presentation"},{"text":"1+"}],[{"text":"Clinical Internship"},{"text":"Strong documented exposure"}]]},{"type":"p","text":"Maintain patient confidentiality and do not publish identifiable patient information without appropriate authorization and consent."}]},{"heading":"Entry-Level Career Options","kind":"careers","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Depending on applicable professional registration and employer requirements:"},{"type":"h","text":"Naturopathy Physician"},{"type":"h","text":"BNYS Clinical Practitioner"},{"type":"h","text":"Naturopathy Medical Officer"},{"type":"h","text":"Yoga Therapy Professional"},{"type":"h","text":"Lifestyle-Management Professional"},{"type":"h","text":"Wellness Physician"},{"type":"h","text":"Clinical Research Assistant"},{"type":"h","text":"Naturopathy Research Associate"},{"type":"h","text":"Preventive-Health Program Associate"},{"type":"h","text":"Integrative Healthcare Coordinator"},{"type":"h","text":"Wellness Centre Clinical Coordinator"},{"type":"h","text":"Employer Skill Matrix"},{"type":"table","header":["Employer Type","Most Valuable Skills"],"rows":[[{"text":"Naturopathy Hospital"},{"text":"Clinical + naturopathic therapies"}],[{"text":"Yoga Therapy Centre"},{"text":"Yoga therapy + patient assessment"}],[{"text":"Wellness Centre"},{"text":"Nutrition + lifestyle + communication"}],[{"text":"Integrative Hospital"},{"text":"Clinical + interdisciplinary collaboration"}],[{"text":"Government Health Program"},{"text":"Preventive health + community care"}],[{"text":"Research Institution"},{"text":"Research + statistics"}],[{"text":"Wellness Resort"},{"text":"Naturopathy + wellness program delivery"}],[{"text":"Private Practice"},{"text":"Clinical + communication + business skills"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"Certifications / Additional Learning"},{"type":"h","text":"Useful areas include:"},{"type":"h","text":"Clinical Nutrition"},{"type":"h","text":"Yoga Therapy"},{"type":"h","text":"Lifestyle Medicine"},{"type":"h","text":"Public Health"},{"type":"h","text":"Clinical Research"},{"type":"h","text":"Biostatistics"},{"type":"h","text":"Health & Wellness Management"},{"type":"h","text":"Behaviour Change"},{"type":"h","text":"Health Informatics"},{"type":"h","text":"Research Methodology"},{"type":"h","text":"Exercise Science"},{"type":"p","text":"Advanced learning should complement the BNYS qualification rather than imply authority outside the applicable professional scope."},{"type":"h","text":"Higher Education Options"},{"type":"h","text":"Potential advanced pathways include:"},{"type":"h","text":"Health & Clinical Areas"},{"type":"h","text":"Postgraduate studies in Naturopathy/Yoga-related disciplines"},{"type":"h","text":"Yoga Therapy"},{"type":"h","text":"Clinical Nutrition"},{"type":"h","text":"Public Health"},{"type":"h","text":"Lifestyle Medicine"},{"type":"h","text":"Research"},{"type":"h","text":"Clinical Research"},{"type":"h","text":"Epidemiology"},{"type":"h","text":"Public Health Research"},{"type":"h","text":"Health Sciences"},{"type":"h","text":"Management"},{"type":"h","text":"MBA Healthcare Management"},{"type":"h","text":"Hospital Administration"},{"type":"h","text":"Wellness Management"},{"type":"h","text":"Healthcare Administration"},{"type":"p","text":"Eligibility and professional recognition vary by program and jurisdiction."},{"type":"h","text":"Career Specializations"},{"type":"h","text":"A BNYS professional can specialize in:"},{"type":"h","text":"Naturopathy"},{"type":"h","text":"Yoga Therapy"},{"type":"h","text":"Clinical Nutrition"},{"type":"h","text":"Lifestyle Management"},{"type":"h","text":"Preventive Healthcare"},{"type":"h","text":"Stress Management"},{"type":"h","text":"Integrative Healthcare"},{"type":"h","text":"Public Health"},{"type":"h","text":"Wellness Medicine"},{"type":"h","text":"Clinical Research"},{"type":"h","text":"Health Education"},{"type":"h","text":"Healthcare Management"}]},{"heading":"Career Progression","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"BNYS Student"},{"type":"h","text":"Clinical Internship"},{"type":"h","text":"Registered / Eligible Professional"},{"type":"h","text":"Junior Naturopathy Physician"},{"type":"h","text":"Naturopathy Physician"},{"type":"h","text":"Senior Naturopathy Physician"},{"type":"h","text":"Clinical Lead"},{"type":"h","text":"Department / Centre Head"},{"type":"h","text":"Integrative Healthcare Leadership"},{"type":"h","text":"Entrepreneurship Route"},{"type":"h","text":"BNYS"},{"type":"h","text":"Clinical Experience"},{"type":"h","text":"Advanced Training"},{"type":"h","text":"Private Practice"},{"type":"h","text":"Naturopathy & Yoga Centre"},{"type":"h","text":"Integrated Wellness Centre"},{"type":"h","text":"Multi-Location Healthcare / Wellness Organization"},{"type":"h","text":"Emerging Areas"},{"type":"p","text":"The field is increasingly intersecting with:"},{"type":"h","text":"Lifestyle medicine"},{"type":"h","text":"Preventive healthcare"},{"type":"h","text":"Integrative medicine"},{"type":"h","text":"Digital health"},{"type":"h","text":"Wearable health technology"},{"type":"h","text":"Personalized wellness"},{"type":"h","text":"Health coaching"},{"type":"h","text":"Sleep science"},{"type":"h","text":"Stress-management programs"},{"type":"h","text":"Clinical outcomes research"},{"type":"h","text":"Population health"},{"type":"h","text":"Health analytics"},{"type":"h","text":"AI-assisted wellness monitoring"},{"type":"h","text":"Recommended Final Skill Stack"},{"type":"h","text":"NATUROPATHY PHYSICIAN"},{"type":"h","text":"│"},{"type":"h","text":"┌────────────────┼────────────────┐"},{"type":"h","text":"↓ ↓ ↓"},{"type":"h","text":"BNYS Clinical Naturopathy Yoga Therapy"},{"type":"h","text":"Knowledge Therapies"},{"type":"h","text":"│ │ │"},{"type":"h","text":"└────────────────┼────────────────┘"},{"type":"h","text":"Patient Assessment"},{"type":"h","text":"Nutrition + Lifestyle"},{"type":"h","text":"Preventive Healthcare"},{"type":"h","text":"Patient Counselling"},{"type":"h","text":"Clinical Safety + Referral"},{"type":"h","text":"Evidence-Based Practice"},{"type":"h","text":"Digital Health + Analytics"},{"type":"h","text":"AI"},{"type":"h","text":"Target Profile by Graduation"},{"type":"p","text":"A strong BNYS graduate should be able to:"},{"type":"p","text":"Apply foundational naturopathic and yogic principles."},{"type":"p","text":"Conduct appropriate patient history and assessment."},{"type":"p","text":"Understand nutrition and lifestyle-related health risks."},{"type":"p","text":"Design appropriate lifestyle and yoga-based interventions within scope."},{"type":"p","text":"Deliver or support naturopathic therapies according to training."},{"type":"p","text":"Recognize contraindications and safety risks."},{"type":"p","text":"Identify cases requiring medical referral."},{"type":"p","text":"Maintain accurate clinical documentation."},{"type":"p","text":"Provide patient education and behaviour-change support."},{"type":"p","text":"Understand preventive healthcare principles."},{"type":"p","text":"Evaluate scientific evidence."},{"type":"p","text":"Participate in clinical and public-health research."},{"type":"p","text":"Use digital health records and monitoring tools."},{"type":"p","text":"Interpret basic health data."},{"type":"p","text":"Apply AI responsibly to healthcare-support workflows."},{"type":"h","text":"Best Overall Positioning"},{"type":"flow","items":["BNYS","Naturopathy","Yoga Therapy","Clinical Assessment","Nutrition","Lifestyle Management","Preventive Healthcare","Patient Counselling","Clinical Safety","Evidence-Based Practice","Digital Health","Research"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"The strongest positioning is to combine the BNYS clinical foundation with evidence-based lifestyle management, nutrition, yoga therapy and digital health skills. This creates pathways into clinical naturopathy, preventive healthcare, integrative healthcare, research, wellness leadership and specialized lifestyle-management programs, while maintaining clear boundaries around professional scope, referral and emergency medical care."}]}]}